  {
   "source": "mcguffey g2 (James/Willie/mamma)",
   "passage": "Everyone likes to see James White with his two dogs. They always seem very happy together. \"Willie, will you run upstairs, and get my needle book from the bureau?\" But Willie did not stir. \"Willie!\" said mamma. She thought he had not heard. \"I am afraid,\" said Willie. \"It is dark up there.\" \"What is the dark?\" asked mamma. \"It is nothing but a shadow.\" And she held her hand between the lamp and the workbasket on the table.",
